# Support TOML front matter

## Requirement

Accept TOML metadata enclosed by `+++` delimiters at the beginning of an `.iasi` document.

## Traceability

- `inputs/externals/objectives.md` · Specific objectives 2
- `inputs/externals/definitions.md` · 3. `.iasi` document

## Verification

Verify the stated behavior through a focused acceptance test or documented inspection. Detailed test cases will be defined during design.
